---
description: Best practices for using ESLint in Angular projects (@angular-eslint v20, ESLint v8)
globs: */src/**/*.ts,*/src/**/*.html
---

- Use ESLint with `@angular-eslint` for TypeScript and template linting
- Extend recommended configs; add project-specific rules minimally
- Integrate ESLint with IDE and CI; fail builds on lint errors
- Use `eslint --fix` for auto-fixable issues; keep rule noise low
- Keep dependencies up to date to match Angular and TS versions

